# F11-17 lab input: data-flow diagram of the university's small teaching cluster.
title Teaching cluster, version 1
external users    Researcher
external admins   Administrator
process  login    Login node
process  control  Scheduler
store    control  Job database
process  compute  Compute node job
store    storage  Shared scratch
store    storage  Home directories
process  registry Container registry
process  mgmt     Node BMC
process  mgmt     Monitoring
store    mgmt     Audit log [log]
flow Researcher -> Login node : ssh session, job scripts
flow Login node -> Scheduler : job submission
flow Scheduler -> Job database : job records
flow Job database -> Scheduler : job records
flow Scheduler -> Compute node job : job launch, user identity
flow Compute node job -> Shared scratch : results
flow Shared scratch -> Compute node job : datasets
flow Home directories -> Login node : files
flow Container registry -> Compute node job : container images
flow Compute node job -> Monitoring : metrics
flow Monitoring -> Node BMC : power and sensor queries
flow Administrator -> Node BMC : console, power control
flow Administrator -> Scheduler : admin commands
flow Scheduler -> Audit log : decisions
